compact('b285','以泥沙守恆與監測辨識養灘的短期重塑和長期功能~Distinguish nourishment reshaping and long-term function through sediment accounting and monitoring',r'''
養灘幾何與方量~Nourishment geometry and volume || 養灘計量先界定施工面、斷面及高程基準，填入的鬆方與完成後剖面方量不必相等。矩形示意適合練習尺寸核對，真實海灘有斜坡與沿岸變化，需要逐剖面積分；初始灘寬也不保證風浪重塑後仍維持相同位置。~Nourishment accounting begins with placement limits, sections and a vertical datum. Delivered loose volume need not equal completed profile volume. A rectangular illustration helps check dimensions, but a real beach varies alongshore and across its slopes and requires section integration; initial width does not guarantee the same shoreline after wave-driven redistribution. || 假設長1000m、增寬20m、等厚1.5m，V=Lbt=30000m³；只作矩形填方示意，不是平衡剖面設計。~Assume length1000m, added width20m and uniform thickness1.5m. V=Lbt=30000m³ is rectangular accounting, not equilibrium-profile design. || 在同一基準上畫施工前後剖面，標出超出量測範圍的部分並逐區積分。核對計量採原狀、鬆方或完成方，與運輸票據比較差異時保留孔隙和含水定義。~Draw before-and-after sections on one datum, identify unmeasured portions and integrate by area. State whether quantities are in-situ, loose or completed volumes; retain porosity and moisture definitions when comparing survey totals with delivery records. || 用車船鬆方直接代替完成灘體會把孔隙變化誤認為流失，缺少近岸水下剖面又會漏掉重分布砂。表面變寬不能單獨證明整個活動剖面已增加足夠儲砂。~Substituting delivered loose volume for completed beach volume confuses porosity change with loss. Missing submerged sections conceal redistributed sand, and a wider dry beach alone does not establish added storage across the active profile. || 施工完成灘寬可以直接當成未來每個季節都固定的岸線。~The completed beach width guarantees an unchanged shoreline in every future season.
固體量與孔隙~Solid quantity and porosity || 養灘材料以固體顆粒量追蹤比較穩定，因為排水及壓密會改變外觀體積。乾質量換算需用顆粒密度而非濕容重，孔隙率亦須對應相同材料狀態；黏土團塊或貝殼會使單一密度近似失準，不能只憑船艙刻度結算泥沙收支。~Tracking solid grains helps distinguish material movement from drainage and compaction. Dry-mass conversion requires grain density rather than wet bulk density, with porosity defined for the same condition. Clay aggregates or shells can invalidate a single-density approximation, so hopper readings alone cannot close the sediment balance. || 假設鬆方10000m³、孔隙率0.40、顆粒密度2650kg/m³，乾砂質量V(1−n)ρs=15900000kg；不含孔隙水。~Assume bulk volume10000m³, porosity0.40 and grain density2650kg/m³. Dry mass V(1−n)ρs=15900000kg, excluding pore water. || 取具代表性的乾濕樣本，分別量含水、顆粒密度及堆積體積，保留採樣位置與重複試驗。把含水造成的重量變化和真正乾固體輸入分開，再檢查換算是否使用同一孔隙定義。~Collect representative wet and dry samples, measuring moisture, grain density and bulk volume with locations and replicates. Separate water-weight changes from dry-solid input, and verify that every conversion uses the same definition of void space. || 若濕砂質量被當成乾砂，輸入固體會被高估，排水後看似大量砂消失。不同批次含貝殼與細料時，沿用同一密度也可能製造不存在的收支缺口。~Treating wet mass as dry mass overstates solid input and makes drainage resemble major sand loss. Variable shell and fine content also makes a single borrowed density create an artificial deficit in the sediment budget. || 孔隙水排出造成的重量下降全部代表養灘砂粒流失。~Every decrease in weight caused by drainage represents loss of nourishment grains.
粒徑相容性~Grain-size compatibility || 借砂與原灘的中值粒徑可作第一層比較，但單一比值會隱藏級配、細料與顆粒形狀。不同粒群在波流中有不同沉降及搬運行為，較粗不必然在所有位置都更好；材料選擇還牽涉生態、灘坡和使用功能，需把各種證據並列。~Median size offers an initial comparison between borrow material and native sand, but one ratio hides grading, fines and particle shape. Different fractions settle and move differently under waves and currents. Coarser is not universally better, and selection also involves ecology, beach slope and intended use, requiring several complementary observations. || 假設借砂D50=0.45mm、原灘D50=0.30mm，比值1.50；不能據此單獨判定全級配相容或保留率。~Assume borrow D50=0.45mm and native D50=0.30mm. Their ratio is1.50; this alone establishes neither grading compatibility nor retention. || 將完整累積粒徑曲線並排，核對細料比例及取樣深度，避免只比中值。另記顆粒形狀、污染篩查與原灘季節變化，說明哪些物理或環境條件仍沒有代表性樣本。~Compare complete cumulative size curves, checking fines and sampling depth rather than only medians. Record particle shape, contaminant screening and seasonal native variability, identifying physical or environmental conditions for which representative field samples remain unavailable. || 中值相同的兩批材料可能有完全不同的細料尾端，入水後一批產生長距離濁羽、另一批迅速沉降。只使用中值配比會錯估輸運與環境影響。~Two materials with identical medians may have very different fine tails; one generates a long plume while another settles quickly. Median-only matching therefore misrepresents both transport behavior and environmental consequences of placement. || 借砂中值粒徑較大即可證明材料全面相容且永不流失。~A larger borrow-sand median proves complete compatibility and permanent retention.
活動剖面平移~Active-profile translation || 把新增體積分配到假想活動剖面，可估計岸線平移的量級，但須先指定陸側高度與閉合水深。實際剖面會調整坡度並沿岸交換泥沙，閉合深度也受觀測期影響；平行平移只是一項幾何假設，不能將計算結果直接當成施工後岸線預測。~Distributing added volume across an assumed active profile gives a shoreline-displacement scale after specifying berm elevation and closure depth. Real profiles change slope and exchange sand alongshore, and closure depth depends on the observation period. Parallel translation is a geometric assumption, not a direct forecast of the actual post-construction beach shoreline. || 假設V=30000m³、沿岸長1000m、閉合深5m、陸側高2m，Δy=V/[L(hc+B)]=4.286m；只限平行平移。~Assume V=30000m³, length1000m, closure depth5m and berm elevation2m. Parallel translation Δy=V/[L(hc+B)]=4.286m. || 清楚標出剖面上下界和零高程，測試閉合深度不同時結果如何改變。用多季節水陸聯測剖面比較實際重塑，將沿岸漏失、坡形變化及測量誤差另列，不強迫資料吻合平移。~Mark profile limits and the vertical origin and test alternative closure depths. Compare multiple seasonal land-and-water surveys with the translation estimate, listing alongshore exchange, slope adjustment and measurement error rather than forcing the measured observations to fit. || 把短期觀測不到變化的位置當成永久閉合深度，會高估岸線移動量；若近岸形成砂壩，材料仍在剖面內卻未出現在乾灘，使僅看岸線的判讀失真。~Treating a temporarily inactive depth as permanent closure can overstate shoreline movement. A nearshore bar may retain sand within the profile without widening the dry beach, misleading interpretations based on shoreline position alone. || 新增砂量除以灘長就能得到岸線前進的長度。~Dividing added sand volume by beach length alone gives shoreline advancement.
沿岸泥沙收支~Alongshore sediment budget || 養灘區不是封閉容器，上下游輸砂差和跨岸交換共同改變儲砂。年度平均通量只適合所定義邊界與時段，暴風、港口阻砂及補砂事件可能打破平穩假設；應先確認輸入輸出各自的符號與單位，再討論需要維持的功能。~A nourishment reach is not a sealed container: alongshore flux differences and cross-shore exchange alter storage. Annual mean transport applies only to its specified boundaries and period. Storms, harbor interception and new placements can break stationarity, so signs and units must be established before discussing the intended coastal function to maintain. || 假設僅沿岸輸入30000、輸出45000m³/year，dV/dt=−15000m³/year；若通量固定5year，儲量減75000m³。~Assume only alongshore input30000 and output45000m³/year. dV/dt=−15000m³/year; fixed fluxes over5years reduce storage75000m³. || 在地圖上標示每個通量邊界、正方向及可觀測證據，檢查是否漏掉近岸或風成砂。用獨立地形差量測試收支殘差，並把不同年份的風暴條件分開而不是只看長期平均。~Map each flux boundary, sign and observational evidence, checking nearshore and windblown pathways. Test budget residuals against independent elevation change and distinguish storm conditions between years rather than relying exclusively on a single long-term average. || 同一砂量在兩個相鄰邊界重複計入會製造假盈餘，忽略跨岸砂壩交換則容易將季節儲存誤認永久流失。平穩外推也可能低估一次大事件的主導作用。~Double-counting sediment at adjacent boundaries creates an artificial surplus, while omitted cross-shore bar exchange makes seasonal storage resemble permanent loss. Stationary extrapolation can also miss the dominant influence of one large event. || 年平均泥沙赤字能保證每個月份都按同一速度退縮。~An annual sediment deficit guarantees an identical retreat rate every month.
壓密與體積變化~Compaction and apparent volume loss || 同一乾固體量隨孔隙改變而呈現不同鬆方，養灘完工後地形下降不一定全是輸砂。需要把粒子輸出和孔隙水排除分開，同時注意級配分選會改變密實狀態；幾何測量提供外形，而固體收支才幫助辨認真正材料流失。~An unchanged quantity of solids occupies different bulk volumes as porosity changes, so post-placement lowering need not be entirely sediment transport. Separate particle export from drainage while recognizing that sorting changes packing. Geometry describes the exterior, whereas solid accounting helps identify actual offshore material loss. || 假設固體體積18000m³保持不變，孔隙率0.40時鬆方30000m³，降到0.35後V=18000/0.65=27692.3m³。~Assume unchanged solid volume18000m³. Bulk volume is30000m³ at porosity0.40 and27692.3m³ at porosity0.35, using V=Vs/(1−n). || 在相同範圍重測剖面並取密度樣本，將沉降量與孔隙改變能解釋的部分比較。保持乾固體定義一致，另查波流輸出證據，避免以任意壓密係數吸收所有量測差異。~Resurvey identical limits and sample density, comparing lowering with the portion explained by changing void space. Maintain a consistent dry-solid definition and inspect transport evidence separately rather than automatically absorbing every discrepancy into an arbitrary compaction factor. || 濕砂表面下降若全部記成侵蝕，會高估維護需求；反過來把真正沖失都稱為壓密，則隱藏砂源不足。缺少密度與地形的共同證據無法區分兩種機制。~Calling all surface lowering erosion overstates maintenance needs, while labeling real export as compaction conceals inadequate supply. Without paired density and terrain evidence, the two mechanisms cannot reliably be distinguished in the completed beach. || 乾固體總量不變時養灘外觀體積必定保持不變。~Unchanged dry-solid quantity requires an unchanged visible bulk volume.
暴風後剖面恢復~Post-storm profile recovery || 暴風可把上灘砂移到水下，後續較緩波況再將部分材料送回，因此恢復率需明示控制範圍與基準。相同乾灘體積恢復不代表粒群或灘形完全恢復，觀測期間亦會左右比例；應同時追蹤總量、位置與功能而非只追一個百分比。~Storms can move upper-beach sand offshore and calmer waves return part of it. A recovery fraction therefore requires explicit survey limits and a reference state. Restored dry-beach volume does not imply identical grading or shape, and the observation interval affects the fraction; track quantity, geographical position and function together. || 假設固定調查範圍暴風減少20000m³，之後回增8000m³，仍缺12000m³、恢復率40%；未證明其餘砂永久外移。~Assume a fixed survey area loses20000m³ in a storm and later gains8000m³. Deficit remains12000m³ and recovery is40%, without proving permanent export. || 保留暴風前、後及恢復期的同範圍剖面，分別記上灘與近岸砂壩的量。核對水位和季節條件，將未觀測水深列為未知，而不把那部分材料自動列為損失。~Retain matching pre-storm, post-storm and recovery surveys, separating upper-beach and nearshore-bar storage. Check water level and season, marking unobserved depths as unknown rather than automatically treating their material as lost from the system. || 恢復期只量乾灘會忽略仍在近岸的庫存，調查邊界移動又可能創造假恢復。若依單一百分比決定補砂，可能反覆搬入材料而沒有處理真正輸砂路徑。~Dry-beach-only monitoring misses nearshore storage, and moving survey boundaries can create artificial recovery. Basing replenishment on one percentage can repeatedly add material without addressing the actual sediment pathways responsible for observed change. || 暴風後尚未回到乾灘的砂都已永久離開海岸系統。~All sand not yet returned to the dry beach has permanently left the coast.
高程偏差與方量~Elevation bias and volume uncertainty || 大面積相減對共同高程偏差非常敏感，許多測點並不能消除同一基準造成的系統誤差。兩期獨立的整面偏差可用不確定度傳播估計量級，但不能與逐格獨立噪音混為一談；這項區別決定應改善控制點還是加密量測。~Large-area differencing is sensitive to coherent vertical bias, and many points do not remove an error shared by one datum. Independent whole-survey offsets can be propagated to estimate uncertainty, but they must not be confused with independent cell noise; that distinction determines whether better control or denser sampling is needed. || 假設面積100000m²，兩期各有獨立整面高程標準不確定度0.03m，σV=A√2σz=4242.6m³；不是逐格獨立誤差。~Assume area100000m² and independent coherent survey offsets with standard uncertainty0.03m each. σV=A√2σz=4242.6m³, not independent cell error. || 用穩定地物及外部控制檢查每期共同偏差，分開報告隨機散布與高程系統分量。重算方量差的不確定度時明列相關性，若兩期共用同一偏差則不可直接套獨立平方和。~Use stable features and external control to check common offsets, reporting random scatter separately from systematic elevation components. State correlations when propagating volume uncertainty; shared bias across both epochs does not permit the same independent sum-of-squares calculation. || 把整面偏差除以測點數平方根會虛構極高精度，使很小的地形差被誤判為侵蝕。共同控制點移動也可能讓兩次調查一起偏移而難以自行察覺。~Dividing coherent bias by the square root of point count invents precision and makes small elevation differences appear significant. Moving common control may also shift both surveys together, escaping detection within the survey network itself. || 增加測點數一定能把共同高程基準偏差平均到零。~Adding more survey points always averages a common datum bias to zero.
背景扣除與濁羽通量~Background correction and plume flux || 濁度光學訊號不直接等於懸浮泥沙質量，需要採樣校正且區分自然背景。橫斷面通量取決於濃度與速度的共同分布，均勻完全混合只是示意；估算增量輸送量不能替代環境許可，粒徑、沉降與暴露時間仍須分別解釋。~An optical turbidity signal is not directly suspended-sediment mass; sampling calibration and background separation are required. Section flux depends jointly on concentration and velocity, with complete uniform mixing only an illustration. Estimated incremental transport does not establish environmental compliance; grading, settling and exposure duration remain separate questions. || 假設均勻濃度150mg/L、背景20mg/L，增量130mg/L=0.13kg/m³，流量2m³/s，增量質量通量0.26kg/s。~Assume uniform concentration150mg/L and background20mg/L. Increment130mg/L=0.13kg/m³; at2m³/s, incremental mass flux is0.26kg/s. || 同步取得背景、作業區濃度和流速，檢查背景點是否真的位於影響區外。以分層樣本辨識垂向差異，記錄光學校正式及適用粒群，將許可條件和質量計算分別比對。~Sample background, working-area concentration and velocity together, verifying that the background station lies outside the affected plume. Use depth-resolved samples to identify stratification, retain optical calibration and applicable grading, and assess permit conditions separately from mass accounting. || 選到已受影響的背景站會低估作業增量，速度和濃度不同時取樣也可能錯配通量。儀器讀值下降可能只是粒徑改變，不一定代表輸送質量減少。~A contaminated background station understates the operational increment, and nonsynchronous concentration and velocity misstate flux. Falling optical readings may reflect changed particle size rather than a reduction in the actual mass being transported. || 濁度儀的光學讀值不經校正就等於泥沙質量濃度。~An uncalibrated optical turbidity reading directly equals sediment mass concentration.
沉降與水平輸運~Settling and horizontal advection || 粒子沉降與水流搬運的競爭影響落砂區，但真實濁羽還有紊流、絮凝和再懸浮。固定沉速及水平流速模型能建立時間與距離量級，不能將單一結果當成影響邊界；初始釋放深度和海床起伏也需與模型坐標一致。~Competition between settling and advection influences deposition, but real plumes also experience turbulence, flocculation and resuspension. Constant settling and current velocities provide time and distance scales, not a definitive impact boundary. Release depth and bed relief must also be consistent with the coordinates used by the simplified model. || 假設距床3m、沉速0.02m/s、水平流0.30m/s，t=h/ws=150s，x=Ut=45m；忽略紊流與再懸浮。~Assume height above bed3m, settling speed0.02m/s and horizontal current0.30m/s. t=150s and x=45m, excluding turbulence and resuspension. || 以沉降柱試驗辨識不同粒群的速度範圍，核對現地潮流轉向及釋放深度。將最簡單軌跡與實測沉積分布比較，保留偏離方向作為混合或再懸浮的證據。~Use settling-column tests to identify velocity ranges for different fractions and check current reversals and release depth. Compare the simplest trajectory with observed deposition, retaining the direction of mismatch as evidence of mixing or resuspension. || 用中值砂粒沉速代表細料會把擴散範圍算得過短，忽略潮流反轉又會放錯沉積方向。沉到床面也不保證永久固定，後續波浪可能重新輸送。~Using median-sand settling speed for fines understates plume extent, while ignoring tidal reversal misplaces deposition. Reaching the bed does not establish permanent retention because later waves can mobilize and transport the same material again. || 粒子第一次碰到海床後就永遠不會再進入水體輸運。~Once a particle first reaches the bed, it can never be transported again.
''')
coastal_meta('b285','假設增寬由20改為22m而長度、厚度不變，方量30000增至33000m³，增加10%；並不代表養灘維持時間增加10%。~Increasing added width from20 to22m at fixed length and thickness raises volume from30000 to33000m³ by10%, without implying10% longer retention.',['beachmanual','pwdm','sandmotor','newbiggin','borth-report'])
META['b285'].update(marks=['荷蘭沙引擎：自然再分布養灘~The Sand Motor: naturally redistributed nourishment','紐比金灣：補砂與防波堤比較~Newbiggin Bay: recharge and breakwater comparison'],place=dict(name='沙引擎公共海岸研究背景區~Sand Motor public coastal research context',country='荷蘭~Netherlands',lat=52.06,lng=4.19,query='Sand Motor Ter Heijde Netherlands'),timeline=[('2007','英國海灘管理手冊更新計畫開始~The UK Beach Management Manual update project begins'),('2011','海灘管理手冊更新完成且荷蘭沙引擎建成~The manual update completes and the Dutch Sand Motor is constructed'),('2013','錫爾迪金發布包含博斯的海灘剖面調查~Ceredigion publishes beach-profile monitoring including Borth')],codes=['海灘管理手冊更新，二〇一一年完成，官方摘要範圍~Beach Management Manual update, completed2011, official summary scope','香港海港工程設計手冊第五部海灘工程，核對勘誤~Hong Kong Port Works Design Manual Part5, beach works and applicable corrigenda'],related=['b286','b288'],history=('養灘的發展不只在搬進更多砂，也在於追蹤砂如何沿岸與跨岸再分布。英國官方記錄海灘管理手冊更新計畫於二〇〇七年開始、二〇一一年完成，重視維護及績效；網頁後來發布的年份不等於手冊完成年份。荷蘭主管機關確認沙引擎於二〇一一年施工，利用自然作用逐步搬運材料。二〇一三年錫爾迪金調查則展示博斯等海岸的連續剖面監測，提醒單一季節不足以代表長期趨勢。本課以這些文件建立觀測觀念，所有砂量、粒徑與速度算例均為原創假設，不聲稱重現專案績效。','Nourishment development concerns tracking cross-shore and alongshore redistribution as well as delivering sand. The UK authority records a manual-update project beginning in2007 and completing in2011, with maintenance and performance emphasized; the later webpage publication date is not the manual-completion date. The Dutch owner confirms construction of the Sand Motor in2011 using natural redistribution. The2013 Ceredigion survey illustrates repeated profiles at Borth and other beaches, warning against equating one season with a long-term trend. These sources establish observational context; every volume, size and velocity calculation here is synthetic rather than a reproduction of project performance.'))
E['b286']=[('~','~')]*10
compact('b286','連結潛堤越頂透射缺口流與海岸地形的相互作用~Connect submerged-breakwater transmission, gap currents and evolving coastal morphology',r'''
淹水深與共同基準~Submergence and shared datum || 潛堤是否淹水取決於堤頂與水位共同高程，不是海圖水深單獨決定。潮汐、增水與沉陷會改變相對淹水深，使同一結構在不同時段呈現不同透流狀態；越頂自由面和波浪運動仍須另行解析，不能把水下高度直接視為減波量。~Submergence depends on crest and water elevations on one datum, not chart depth alone. Tide, surge and settlement change relative cover, so the same structure experiences different transmission states. The overtopping free surface and wave motion still need separate analysis; water cover cannot directly represent the amount of wave reduction or the resulting shoreline response. || 假設水位2.0m、堤頂1.2m，淹水深0.8m；入射波高1.6m時相對淹水深0.50，非透射係數。~Assume water level2.0m and crest1.2m. Cover is0.8m; relative to incident height1.6m the ratio is0.50, not transmission. || 將潮位、堤頂測量及海床資料轉到同一高程基準，保留每筆測量時間。分別列出高低水位時的覆水範圍，並檢查堤頂起伏，避免以平均值掩蓋局部深缺口。~Convert tide, crest and seabed observations to one vertical datum and retain timestamps. List cover at different levels and inspect crest irregularities, ensuring an average elevation does not conceal a locally deep notch or missing section. || 不同高程基準相混可能把實際淹沒堤頂算成出水，直接改變選用的水理機制。局部低點若未量到，也可能集中越頂流而造成後側沖刷。~Mixed elevation datums can turn a submerged crest into an apparently emerged one and select the wrong hydraulic mechanism. An unmeasured low point may also concentrate overtopping flow and cause localized scour behind the structure. || 相對淹水深等於波高透射係數且不受堤寬影響。~Relative submergence equals the wave-height transmission coefficient regardless of crest width.
波高與能量透射~Wave-height and energy transmission || 透射波高比描述振幅變化，能量通量還涉及群速度與水深，不能直接以相同百分比換算。量測必須分離入射反射及透射成分，兩側頻譜也可能因破波而改變；只有明定波型與能量定義後，才可比較堤前與堤後的水理量。~Wave-height transmission describes amplitude, whereas energy flux also depends on group velocity and depth. Measurements must separate incident, reflected and transmitted components, and breaking can change the spectrum. Only after defining wave type and energy consistently can measurements on either side be compared; an amplitude percentage is not automatically an energy percentage. || 假設Hi=2m、Ht=0.8m，Kt=0.40；相同密度且群速比Cgt/Cgi=0.80時，能量通量比Kt²×0.80=0.128。~Assume Hi=2m and Ht=0.8m, giving Kt=0.40. Equal density and group-speed ratio0.80 give energy-flux ratio Kt²×0.80=0.128. || 配置可區分反射的多點波面量測，使用一致的分析時窗與頻譜定義。另求兩側群速度並說明水深假設，檢查高頻重分配，不能只比較兩支儀器顯示的最大峰值。~Use multiple wave gauges to separate reflection with consistent windows and spectral definitions. Determine group velocities on both sides and state depth assumptions, checking redistributed high-frequency energy rather than comparing only the maximum displayed by two sensors. || 把堤前駐波腹當成入射波高會低估透射係數，兩側群速差若被忽略則錯估能量。即使整體透射降低，缺口附近仍可能有局部高波。~Mistaking a standing-wave antinode for incident height understates transmission, and neglected group-speed differences distort energy estimates. Lower overall transmission can still coexist with locally high waves near a gap in the breakwater. || 波高減少六成就必然表示能量通量也只減少六成。~A sixty-percent reduction in wave height always means exactly sixty-percent less energy flux.
破波水深尺度~Depth-limited breaking scale || 淺水破波受波陡、坡度與水深限制，常見破波指標只是特定資料範圍下的近似。潛堤頂部流速和波形會改變，短堤頂也未必達到平衡破波；教學比例應用於辨識量級，不能被當成任何不規則波條件下的固定上限。~Shallow breaking depends on steepness, bed slope and depth, and a breaker index approximates a limited range of observations. Crest currents and wave shape change over a submerged structure, and a short crest may not develop equilibrium breaking. A teaching ratio establishes scale rather than a universal ceiling for every irregular-wave condition. || 假設選用破波指標γb=0.78、水深h=2m，Hb=γbh=1.56m；此係數非所有潛堤的通用設計值。~Assume a selected breaker indexγb=0.78 at depth2m. Hb=γbh=1.56m; the index is not a universal submerged-breakwater design value. || 在示意剖面上標出實際水深定義，對比不同水位和波週期下的破波位置。保留試驗中未破波與碎波資料，說明所選指標的來源範圍，不把觀察外的海況直接外推。~Mark the depth definition on a section and compare breaking positions for different levels and periods. Retain both broken and unbroken observations, state the evidence range for the chosen index, and avoid extrapolating it directly to untested seas. || 水位升高可能使原先碎波的位置消失，波能穿過堤頂後才耗散。若一直使用同一破波位置和係數，後側波況與岸灘受力可能被系統性低估。~Rising water can remove a former breaking location so that energy dissipates only after crossing the crest. Keeping the same breaking point and coefficient can systematically understate lee-side waves and beach exposure during higher water. || 只要堤頂水深固定所有週期和波形都在同一高度破波。~At fixed crest depth every period and waveform breaks at exactly the same height.
缺口連續流量~Gap-flow continuity || 堤後水位抬升產生回流，缺口可能集中流量並形成局部沖刷或游泳風險。面積平均流速只能滿足連續方程，不代表最大紊流或近床速度；流向會隨潮波改變，分析需要把堤段越頂輸入與缺口排出放在同一收支框架。~Setup behind a structure can drive return flow through gaps and concentrate scour or exposure. Section-mean velocity satisfies continuity but is not the maximum turbulent or near-bed velocity. Direction changes with tides and waves, so crest inflow and gap outflow must be evaluated within one water budget rather than as unrelated local observations. || 假設穩定缺口流量30m³/s、有效過水面積20m²，平均v=Q/A=1.50m/s；不等於局部最大流速。~Assume steady gap discharge30m³/s through effective area20m². Mean v=Q/A=1.50m/s, not the local maximum velocity. || 沿缺口橫斷面量測速度與水深，積分流量並核對堤後水位變化。分別報告平均、近床和瞬時峰值，保存潮向與波況，避免把單點尖峰直接當成整斷面流量。~Measure velocity and depth across the gap, integrating discharge and comparing it with lee-side level change. Report means, near-bed values and peaks separately with tide and waves; one-point spikes cannot represent discharge over the entire section. || 斷面局部被砂堆堵塞時平均面積假設失效，剩餘通道流速可能增加。若儀器只放在緩流區，收支殘差會掩蓋真正的集中流和沖刷熱點。~Partial blockage by sediment invalidates the assumed area and can accelerate flow through the remaining opening. Instruments placed only in slow water conceal concentrated currents and scour hotspots behind apparently modest mean-flow observations. || 缺口平均流速可以直接當成每一個位置的瞬時最大流速。~The gap-average velocity directly gives the instantaneous maximum at every point.
規則波能通量~Regular-wave energy flux || 波能公式必須說明波高代表規則波還是頻譜顯著波高，兩者係數不同。群速度傳遞能量而相速度描述波峰移動，混用會改變功率；入射角、反射和耗散也影響垂直結構方向的能流，單位寬度結果不能直接當成整座結構承受的總負荷。~Wave-energy formulas must identify whether height is regular-wave height or spectral significant height because their coefficients differ. Group velocity transports energy while phase velocity follows crests. Incidence, reflection and dissipation also affect the normal energy flux, so a result per unit crest width does not directly describe total structural loading or impact pressure. || 假設規則線性波ρ=1025kg/m³、H=2m、Cg=5m/s，E=ρgH²/8=5027.6J/m²，P=ECg=25.138kW/m。~Assume a regular linear wave:ρ=1025kg/m³, H=2m, Cg=5m/s. E=ρgH²/8=5027.6J/m² and P=25.138kW/m. || 在計算表明列波高統計定義、密度及群速來源，確認每米寬度的方向。用能量收支比較反射透射與耗散；若改用顯著波高，重新選頻譜能量公式而不是保留原係數。~Record height convention, density and group-velocity derivation and define the direction of unit width. Compare reflected, transmitted and dissipated fluxes; when switching to significant height, select the corresponding spectral-energy formula instead of retaining the regular-wave coefficient. || 使用顯著波高卻套規則波係數會使能量差一倍，拿相速度代群速度又增加另一偏差。數值即使量綱正確，仍可能因統計定義不同而不可比較。~Using significant height in the regular-wave formula doubles the energy estimate, and substituting phase velocity adds another bias. Dimensionally correct numbers may still be incomparable because the underlying statistical definition is different. || 規則波高和顯著波高可直接代入同一能量係數而無差別。~Regular height and significant height can use the same energy coefficient without change.
床面剪力無因次化~Dimensionless bed shear || 潛堤改變波流剪力後可能引發近床輸砂，粒徑與相對密度決定顆粒重量尺度。希爾茲參數只把作用力無因次化，起動條件還受級配、床面形態與振盪流影響；不能由單一參數宣告侵蝕深度，亦不能跳過黏性細料與非黏性砂的不同機制。~Modified wave-current shear can mobilize sediment, with grain size and relative density setting the gravitational scale. The Shields parameter nondimensionalizes forcing; onset also depends on grading, bed form and oscillatory motion. One parameter does not give scour depth, and cohesive fines require a different treatment from the noncohesive grains assumed here. || 假設τ=2Pa、ρs=2650、ρ=1025kg/m³、D=0.0005m，θ=τ/[(ρs−ρ)gD]=0.2509；未指定起動門檻。~Assumeτ=2Pa,ρs=2650,ρ=1025kg/m³ and D=0.0005m. θ=τ/[(ρs−ρ)gD]=0.2509, without prescribing a motion threshold. || 核對剪力是瞬時或週期平均以及粒徑代表值，對照原床級配與黏性。以床形和起動觀察檢驗假設，另做沖刷深度分析，不能把一個無因次比值直接換成挖深。~Check whether shear is instantaneous or cycle-averaged and identify representative size, grading and cohesion. Test assumptions against observed motion and bed form; analyze scour depth separately rather than converting one dimensionless ratio directly into an excavation depth. || 將黏土當成同粒徑砂會忽略顆粒間作用，僅取平均剪力又漏掉波峰短暫起動。錯誤起動判斷可能使原本穩定的基床保護假設突然失效。~Treating clay as sand of equal size omits interparticle forces, while mean shear can miss brief wave-driven motion. Incorrect onset interpretation may invalidate the assumed stability of the bed supporting or protecting the structure. || 希爾茲參數的數值本身就是預期海床沖刷深度。~The numerical Shields parameter directly equals the expected seabed scour depth.
淺水傳播時間~Shallow-water propagation time || 長波相對水深很淺時，重力與水深控制傳播速度，可用來估計堤後區域的響應時間。這個近似不適用任意短波，亦未計底摩擦或水流影響；地形改變既影響速度也可能造成反射，因此傳播時間只是辨識訊號因果的一項線索。~For sufficiently long waves relative to depth, gravity and depth control propagation speed and give a response-time scale behind the structure. The approximation does not apply to arbitrary short waves and excludes friction and currents. Bathymetric changes affect speed and reflections, so travel time is only one clue for interpreting cause and effect in observations. || 假設線性淺水長波h=2m，c=√(gh)=4.429m/s；傳播100m約22.58s，需滿足水深遠小於波長。~Assume a linear shallow-water long wave at depth2m. c=√(gh)=4.429m/s;100m takes22.58s, requiring depth much smaller than wavelength. || 使用觀測週期檢查淺水條件，再比較兩站訊號延遲與估算傳播時間。同步校正儀器時鐘並檢查流向，若延遲不符，先查反射與群波影響而非直接調整水深湊合。~Check the shallow-water condition using observed periods, then compare interstation delay with the estimate. Synchronize clocks and inspect current direction; investigate reflection and wave groups before changing assumed depth merely to force agreement with the recorded lag. || 儀器時間不同步會製造假的傳播速度，短波套長波公式則錯估延遲。把相關性峰值自動解釋為同一波列，還可能忽略反射訊號的替代來源。~Unsynchronized instruments create false travel speeds, and short waves modeled as long waves produce incorrect delays. Automatically interpreting a correlation peak as one traveling wave can also overlook reflections as an alternative signal source. || 所有海浪的傳播速度都只由水深決定而與波長無關。~Every ocean wave travels at a speed determined only by depth, regardless of wavelength.
離岸幾何與岸線~Offshore geometry and shoreline response || 堤長與離岸距離影響遮蔽區形狀，但岸線反應同時受波向、輸砂供應及缺口控制。幾何比例可以整理案例，不能直接預報連島砂洲或突出灘形成；功能比較還需確認結構淹水狀態及尺度，避免將出水防波堤經驗直接移植到潛堤。~Length and offshore distance influence the sheltered footprint, but wave direction, sediment supply and gaps also govern shoreline response. A geometric ratio organizes comparisons; it does not directly predict a salient or tombolo. Comparisons must account for submergence and scale rather than transferring emerged-breakwater experience directly to a submerged structure in a different sediment regime. || 假設堤長L=100m、離岸距X=200m，L/X=0.50；僅為幾何描述，不是連島砂洲必然形成的門檻。~Assume length100m and offshore distance200m. L/X=0.50 describes geometry only and is not a threshold guaranteeing tombolo formation. || 在同一岸線基準下量堤長與距離，記錄波向分布、沿岸砂源和缺口位置。比較不同季節地形及鄰岸變化，將相似幾何但不同淹水條件的案例分開解讀。~Measure length and distance against a consistent shoreline reference and record directional waves, sediment supply and gaps. Compare seasonal and neighboring terrain, distinguishing geometrically similar cases whose submergence and transport conditions differ substantially from the site under study. || 某一波向下的堆砂可能在季風轉向後消失，上游攔砂也可能讓遮蔽區缺乏材料。只憑幾何比例許諾岸線效果，會忽略整段海岸的收支限制。~Accumulation under one wave direction may disappear after seasonal reversal, while updrift interception leaves little sand for the shelter. Geometry-only promises therefore ignore sediment-budget limitations across the wider coast and its changing wave climate. || 堤長與離岸距的比值足以唯一決定未來岸線形狀。~The length-to-offshore-distance ratio uniquely determines the future shoreline shape.
堤頂沉陷與覆水~Crest settlement and water cover || 潛堤長期沉陷會增加覆水並改變波浪互動，不能只把沉陷看成材料方量問題。局部差異沉陷還形成優先過流通道，而透射對幾何的反應通常非線性；需要把結構監測、水位歷程與水理測試放在同一狀態描述中追蹤。~Settlement increases water cover and changes wave interaction rather than merely reducing material volume. Differential movement also creates preferred flow paths, while transmission often responds nonlinearly to geometry. Structural surveys, water-level history and hydraulic observations therefore need to describe the same evolving state; a percentage change in cover cannot determine an equal change in transmission. || 假設水位固定、原覆水0.8m，堤頂沉陷0.2m後覆水1.0m，增加25%；不能推論透射波高也增25%。~Assume fixed water level and original cover0.8m. Crest settlement0.2m raises cover to1.0m, a25% increase, not necessarily25% higher transmission. || 重測堤頂縱剖面並連結共同水位，分離均勻沉陷與局部凹槽。以相近波況比較前後透射，保留地基與構件位移紀錄，確認變化是否來自沉陷而非潮位差。~Resurvey the crest against a shared water datum, separating uniform settlement from local troughs. Compare transmission under similar waves and retain foundation and unit-movement records, checking whether the observed change results from settlement rather than different tidal levels. || 量測只追最高點會漏掉主要低槽，平均沉陷很小仍可能有集中水流。不同潮位的透射資料若直接比較，則可能把水位造成的差別誤認為結構損壞。~Tracking only crest high points misses controlling troughs, allowing concentrated flow despite small mean settlement. Comparing transmission at different tides can instead mistake a water-level effect for deterioration of the physical structure. || 覆水深度增加百分比必定等於透射波高增加百分比。~The percentage increase in water cover must equal the percentage increase in transmitted height.
數值步長與收斂~Numerical timestep and convergence || 地形整合模型需要同時考慮波流與泥沙的數值尺度，計算能運行不代表已收斂。特徵速度限制顯式步長，但邊界、乾濕轉換及所用格式可能更嚴；網格與步長應分別細化，並保持物理邊界一致，才能分辨數值擴散與真實地形平滑。~A morphology model must resolve wave-current and sediment scales, and successful execution does not establish convergence. Characteristic speed constrains an explicit timestep, while boundaries, wetting and drying or the selected scheme may be more restrictive. Refine space and time separately under unchanged physical boundaries to distinguish numerical diffusion from genuine smoothing of coastal terrain. || 假設一維顯式淺水示意U=2m/s、h=2m、Δt=0.5s、Δx=5m，C=(U+√gh)Δt/Δx=0.6429；非穩定保證。~Assume a one-dimensional explicit shallow-water illustration: U=2m/s,h=2m,Δt=0.5s,Δx=5m. C=(U+√gh)Δt/Δx=0.6429, not guaranteed stability. || 逐區檢查最小網格、最大特徵速度與時間步長，確認採用格式的條件。另做網格和步長細化，核對水量與泥沙守恆殘差，保存未收斂區域而不只展示平滑的彩色圖。~Check local minimum spacing, maximum characteristic speed and timestep against the actual scheme. Refine grid and time separately, audit water and sediment residuals, and retain unconverged regions rather than displaying only smooth and visually persuasive contour maps. || 平均網格符合條件仍可能在小網格區失穩，過度數值擴散則可能掩蓋缺口流。圖像平滑不代表守恆正確，錯誤地形趨勢甚至可能看起來很合理。~A satisfactory average grid hides instability in smaller cells, while excessive diffusion conceals gap currents. Smooth graphics do not establish conservation, and an incorrect morphological trend can still appear visually plausible to an uncritical observer. || 模型圖形平滑且沒有報錯就代表網格與時間步長已收斂。~Smooth output without error messages proves that grid and timestep convergence is complete.
''')
